<view class="container">
  <view class="card">
    <picker range="{{daily}}" value="{{dailyIndex}}" bindchange="pickDaily">
      <view class="row item">
        <view>每天新学</view>
        <view class="muted">{{daily[dailyIndex]}} 个词 ›</view>
      </view>
    </picker>
    <view class="row item">
      <view>
        <view>拼写题</view>
        <view class="muted hint">记得比较牢的词会让你拼一拼</view>
      </view>
      <switch checked="{{spell}}" bindchange="toggleSpell" color="#2f6fed" />
    </view>
  </view>
  <view class="muted note">复习的时间由记忆算法（FSRS）安排：答对的词间隔越来越长，答错的很快会再出现。</view>
</view>
